0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F2 28 Tf 72 690 Td (Planning the journey) Tj ET
0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 672 60 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (Every slow journey begins with a decision to leave something out. Fewer connections, fewer) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 611 Td (bookings and fewer bags make room for the things that happen between stations.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (Choose a start and an end, then let the middle stay loose. A good route has one fixed point) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 554 Td (a day and a long afternoon with nothing in it.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (3) Tj ET
endstream
