0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F2 22 Tf 72 690 Td (Packing light) Tj ET
0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 674 40 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (Carry what you can lift with one hand while you drink tea with the other. A change of) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 611 Td (clothes, a notebook, a paper map and a spare charger cover almost every journey.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (Pack the night before and leave a quarter of the bag empty for what you collect on the way.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (4) Tj ET
endstream
