stream
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F2 28 Tf 72 690 Td (Getting around) Tj ET
0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 672 60 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (Trains are the heart of a slow journey. Windows that open, a dining car that serves tea,) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 611 Td (and a timetable that rewards patience.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (Buses fill the gaps between the lines, and ferries tie the coast together. Ask at each) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 554 Td (station which way the locals go; the answer is rarely the one the app gives.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (5) Tj ET
endstream
