stream
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F2 22 Tf 72 690 Td (Trains) Tj ET
0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 674 40 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (Book the night train when the distance is long. You trade a hotel bill for a narrow bed) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 611 Td (and wake up somewhere new. Take a window seat, an early dinner and a book you will not finish.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (Day trains are for watching. Sit facing forward and let the landscape do the talking.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (6) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
