0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F2 28 Tf 72 690 Td (Eating well) Tj ET
0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 672 60 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (Eat where the menu is short and the room is full. Order what the next table is having.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 592 Td (Breakfast is the meal that tells you most about a place. Find the bakery with the queue) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (and the cafe where nobody looks at a phone.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (7) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
