stream
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F2 22 Tf 72 690 Td (Markets) Tj ET
0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 674 40 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (A market is the quickest way to learn a town. Walk a full lap before you buy anything,) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 611 Td (then go back for the stall that smelled best. Carry cash and small change.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (Buy bread, cheese and fruit for the next train. A picnic on a night train beats any menu.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (8) Tj ET
endstream
