0.95 0.62 0.25 rg 72 672 60 3 re f
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 630 Td (The last day of a journey should be quiet. Walk the streets you walked on the first) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 611 Td (morning and notice what has changed, which is mostly you.) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 573 Td (Write down three things you want to keep. Then plan the next journey before the bags) Tj ET
0.12 0.15 0.20 rg BT /F1 13 Tf 72 554 Td (are unpacked.) Tj ET
0.40 0.44 0.50 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 302 44 Td (9) Tj ET
